cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "UCAS Educational Big Data — ML Graduation Prediction"
abstract: >
  PySpark and scikit-learn implementation of a machine learning framework
  for predicting student graduation outcomes in IT majors at the University
  College of Applied Sciences (UCAS), Gaza, Palestine. Applies Decision Tree,
  Random Forest, and Gradient Boosting Tree algorithms on 19 years of
  educational data (2000–2019), with Apache Spark for parallel execution.

